IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `coa-formation-shares-buyback`

-- Companies Act 1967 -- incorporation, s 161 share issues, substantial shareholdings and controllers, a selective buy-back
-- and the company limited by guarantee -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked against a
-- decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved). Expected values were written by hand from the text. Variant
-- fixtures were expanded from their base fixture by a script (scratchpad gen_req0284.py), one field changed in each.
--
-- THE REQ-0284 FACTS (assumed where the ledger is silent): Haziq incorporates a private company limited by shares with
-- himself as its only director, ordinarily resident in Singapore. The subscribers take 55 shares (Haziq) and 20 shares (Bee),
-- one class of ordinary shares. The company then issues 25 shares to an investor, Ivan: 25 of 100 = 25%. Later it buys back
-- all 20 of Bee's shares (20% of 100) by a selective off-market purchase and cancels them, leaving 80. Ivan now holds 25 of 80.
-- Later still Haziq incorporates a company limited by guarantee. No body here is declared by the Minister under s 79(2), and
-- neither company is in the Fourteenth Schedule. The companies are incorporated after the s 386AF(14) appointed day.

§ `Fixtures`

`Haziq's private company` MEANS
    Formation WITH
        `the kind of company` IS `limited by shares`
        `it is to have a share capital` IS TRUE
        `the constitution and prescribed documents were submitted` IS TRUE
        `the last day of the first financial year was furnished` IS TRUE
        `the prescribed fee was paid` IS TRUE
        `the section 19(2) declaration was made by` IS `a person named in the constitution as a director`
        `the declaration covers compliance and the verification of identities` IS TRUE
        `the constitution is dated and states its name, the members' liability and the subscribers` IS TRUE
        `the constitution states the guarantee up to a specified amount` IS FALSE
        `the constitution states the number of members it is registering with` IS FALSE
        `each subscriber declared the number of shares taken, not less than one` IS TRUE
        `named directors ordinarily resident in Singapore` IS 1
        `every named director is a natural person of 18 or over of full capacity` IS TRUE
        `every named director filed consent and the section 146(1A) statements before incorporation` IS TRUE
        `the constitution restricts the right to transfer shares` IS TRUE
        `the constitution limits the members to not more than 50` IS TRUE
        `the Registrar is satisfied of a section 20(2) ground` IS FALSE

